[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":105},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","b1ryhk6l88lsscw1c7ftielx4","revision",1,"title","质疑亚马逊卖家首年盈利数据","originalTitle","Yesterday, @Molson_Hart shared an Amazon impact study (performed by Oxford Economics) that said 98% of Amazon sellers are profitable in t...","summary","昨天，@Molson_Hart 分享了一项由牛津经济研究院进行的亚马逊影响研究，称98%的亚马逊卖家在第一年就能盈利。\n\n我怀疑这98%的数据是否属实，但假设它是真的……\n\n在亚马逊上销售比以往任何时候都更难，而且非常辛苦。\n\n这不是投资建议，但如果你想获得对亚马逊市场的敞口，直接购买 $PTRN 可能更好","reason","source",{"_9":99,"_100":101,"_81":102,"_103":39,"_104":-5},"links",{"_96":97,"_66":98},"publishedAt","2026-10-07T17:20:01.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T15:58:16.866Z","timelineAt","category","product","tags",[93,94,95],"score",20,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","guyfosel","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>Yesterday, @Molson_Hart shared an Amazon impact study (performed by Oxford Economics) that said 98% of Amazon sellers are profitable in their first year.</p><p>I doubt that 98% number is true, but let's say it is...</p><p>Selling on Amazon is harder than ever, and a GRIND.</p><p>Not investing advice but if you want exposure to the Amazon marketplace, you might be better off just buying $PTRN</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Bearded Egg FBA 🛠️","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[80],{"_81":82,"_83":84,"_85":86,"_87":88,"_89":90,"_91":-5,"_92":-5},"kind","image","url","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","srcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 1200w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 1600w","width",795,"height",411,"alt","poster","行业动态","选品/市场","亚马逊","aihot","/items/b1ryhk6l88lsscw1c7ftielx4","https://x.com/guyfosel/status/2107883659177214437","x-bearded-egg-fba","name","X · Bearded Egg FBA","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_106":107},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
